{"region": "americas", "note": "The Eras level. Sourced areas carry the cited periods of a published periodization (cite); elsewhere, and after an area's last period, the region's period bins per lane group (basis: period-bin), kept only where the data records a state or culture. Leaders are computed from the spans: most lane-years, weighted by tier.", "areas": [{"id": "eastern-north-america", "label": "Eastern North America", "lanes": ["canada", "united-states"], "note": "Periods of the Eastern Woodlands from the table of North American archaeological periods. Southern Canada is included because the table lists Canadian Hopewellian complexes (Point Peninsula, Laurel, Saugeen) in the Middle Woodland. The Arctic, the Plains and the Southwest have their own sequences; their cultures appear at the deeper levels.", "sources": [{"page": "List of archaeological periods (North America)", "revid": 1374389226, "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_archaeological_periods_%28North_America%29", "permalink": "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=1374389226"}]}, {"id": "mesoamerica", "label": "Mesoamerica", "lanes": ["mexico", "guatemala", "belize", "el-salvador", "honduras"], "note": "The summary table of Mesoamerican chronology. Mesoamerica covers central and southern Mexico, Guatemala, Belize, El Salvador and western Honduras; northern Mexico lies outside it but shares the column. The Terminal Classic (800–900/1000) overlaps the Late Classic and is folded into it here.", "sources": [{"page": "Mesoamerican chronology", "revid": 1376988322, "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mesoamerican_chronology", "permalink": "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=1376988322"}]}, {"id": "antilles", "label": "Antilles", "lanes": ["cuba", "jamaica", "haiti", "dominican-republic", "puerto-rico", "lesser-antilles", "trinidad-and-tobago"], "note": "The three ages of Caribbean prehistory as given in the list of pre-Columbian cultures (citing Rouse 1992). They describe the Greater and Lesser Antilles as a whole; not every island was settled in every age.", "sources": [{"page": "List of pre-Columbian cultures", "revid": 1379074716, "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_pre-Columbian_cultures", "permalink": "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=1379074716"}]}, {"id": "bahamas", "label": "Bahamas", "lanes": ["bahamas"], "note": "The list names the Bahamas only for the Lucayans of the Late Ceramic Age (700–1500 AD).", "sources": [{"page": "List of pre-Columbian cultures", "revid": 1379074716, "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_pre-Columbian_cultures", "permalink": "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=1379074716"}]}, {"id": "andes", "label": "Andes", "lanes": ["colombia", "ecuador", "peru", "bolivia", "chile", "argentina"], "note": "Rowe and Lanning's periods for 'Peru and the Andean Region'. The list of pre-Columbian cultures uses the same periods for cultures in Colombia, Ecuador, Bolivia, Chile and Argentina, so those columns share them; the periods describe their Andean parts. The list dates the Early Horizon to 900 BC–200 AD and the Early Intermediate to 200–600 AD; the periodization article, used here, has 900–200 BCE and 200 BCE–600 CE.", "sources": [{"page": "Periodization of pre-Columbian Peru", "revid": 1379392492, "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Periodization_of_pre-Columbian_Peru", "permalink": "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=1379392492"}]}, {"id": "group-north-america", "label": null, "group": "north-america", "lanes": ["greenland", "canada", "united-states"], "bins": true}, {"id": "group-mexico-central", "label": null, "group": "mexico-central", "lanes": ["mexico", "guatemala", "belize", "el-salvador", "honduras", "nicaragua", "costa-rica", "panama"], "bins": true}, {"id": "group-caribbean", "label": null, "group": "caribbean", "lanes": ["bahamas", "cuba", "jamaica", "haiti", "dominican-republic", "puerto-rico", "lesser-antilles", "trinidad-and-tobago"], "bins": true}, {"id": "group-northern-south", "label": null, "group": "northern-south", "lanes": ["colombia", "venezuela", "guyana", "suriname", "french-guiana"], "bins": true}, {"id": "group-andes", "label": null, "group": "andes", "lanes": ["ecuador", "peru", "bolivia", "chile"], "bins": true}, {"id": "group-plata", "label": null, "group": "plata", "lanes": ["brazil", "paraguay", "uruguay", "argentina"], "bins": true}],
